("politics","Midterms: 15 days out","Every House seat, 35 Senate races and 36 governor races are on the ballot Nov 3. Last week's polls cut both ways: Bowling Green/YouGov has Brown (D) up 48-42 in Ohio, InsiderAdvantage has Collins (R) trailing Jackson (D) 49-47 in Maine, and the same pollster has Paxton (R) up 49-48 in Texas. Most margins are inside the error.","Nov 3",[("Roundup of new Senate polls (Newsmax wires via Yahoo)","https://www.yahoo.com/news/politics/articles/polls-gop-trouble-ohio-iowa-160419601.html"),("Marist Iowa poll","https://maristpoll.marist.edu/polls/2026-midterm-elections-in-iowa-october-2026/"),("NYT Senate polls tracker","https://www.nytimes.com/interactive/polls/senate-polls-2026.html")],"Midterms2026",None,1),
