("politics","60 Minutes on the people who count the votes","Lesley Stahl's Sunday report, \"The Vote,\" looked at federal actions affecting state and local election officials ahead of Nov 3, including an FBI search of a Fulton County, Georgia election warehouse and Justice Department requests for voter rolls. It featured Utah Lt. Gov. Deidre Henderson and Justice Department official Harmeet Dhillon, so both state officials and DOJ gave their side.","Oct 18",[("CBS News: transcript","https://www.cbsnews.com/news/election-officials-voting-system-investigations-60-minutes-transcript/"),("CBS News: full episode","https://www.cbsnews.com/video/60minutes-2026-10-18/"),("Paramount Press Express: listings","https://www.paramountpressexpress.com/cbs-news-and-stations/shows/60-minutes/releases/?view=113433-60-minutes-listings-for-sunday-october-18")],"60Minutes","politics/elections-2026/",0),
