("world","Hormuz: Iran floats a reopening plan","Iran says it would reopen the Strait of Hormuz under a seven-day plan if the U.S. meets its conditions, including ending hostilities and lifting the naval blockade. Washington hasn't accepted, and Qatar is mediating. Last week at least nine ships were attacked near the strait. Brent eased to about $107 on Monday morning after touching $110.","Oct 18 to 19",[("Arab News","https://www.arabnews.com/middle-east/iran-urges-us-to-accept-proposal-to-reopen-strait-of-hormuz-3006986"),("Gulf News","https://gulfnews.com/world/mena/us-israel-iran-war-hormuz-deal-unresolved-us-renews-warning-to-americans-1.500715439"),("CNBC","https://www.cnbc.com/2026/10/16/oil-price-today-iran-strait-hormuz-ukraine-russia.html"),("NBC News","https://www.nbcnews.com/business/energy/oil-prices-hormuz-iran-ukraine-rcna603919"),("AP","https://apnews.com/article/saudi-arabia-yemen-houthis-october-13-2026-3e6e5f152048c035081eac369f62ed4f")],"Hormuz","money/gas-prices-2026/",1),
